{"id": "36313", "title": "野草疯长", "author": "杨子昂", "category": "文学名著", "count": 35, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/36/36313/36313s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/36/36313.htm", "intro": "《野草疯长》写于2001年，作者时年18岁。其所指，在于一个颇特立独行的叛逆少年，之于青春的残酷体验，之于窒息教育的另类抉择。这部小说以王九哥的第一人称为叙述，其灰色轨迹颇令人思索，令人扼腕，也令人惊诧。虽九年已去，仍割舍不下在浮躁、稚嫩文字背后的激情表达，今不愿改动，原文再现。小说有控诉，有偏激，却真情实感地表达着源于社会底层的苦涩与果决。这并非公民主义的小说，却孕育着公民的可能。", "base": "files/article/html/36/36313", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "第一章 上", "file": "2689970.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第一章 下", "file": "2689972.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二章 上", "file": "2689975.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二章 下", "file": "2689977.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三章 上", "file": "2689980.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三章 下", "file": "2689982.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四章 上", "file": "2689985.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四章 下", "file": "2689987.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五章 上", "file": "2689990.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五章 下", "file": "2689992.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六章 上", "file": "2689995.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六章 下", "file": "2689997.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七章 上", "file": "2690000.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七章 下", "file": "2690003.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八章 上", "file": "2690006.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八章 下", "file": "2690009.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第九章 上", "file": "2690011.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第九章 下", "file": "2690013.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十章 上", "file": "2690016.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十章 下", "file": "2690019.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十一章 上", "file": "2690021.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十一章 下", "file": "2690023.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十二章 上", "file": "2690026.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十二章 下", 